      "t": "'Is that really an act of truce?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "vika",
      "t": "Витя, ты вообще в своём уме?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Vitya, are you in your right mind at all?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Да вы ничего не докажете!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You will not prove a thing!'",
      "gap": 0.45
